codex
A better `C=128` compromise is one BF16 packed GEMM for the four triangular projections plus one FP32 GEMM for `out_gate`. That keeps the sensitive final gate accurate and avoids four separate BF16 GEMMs, so I’m adding a packed-4 Triton prep kernel for that branch.
